d retry makes the push leg non-blocking | 2026-08-11.md | 2026-08-14 |\n| [[concepts/browser-automation-stack-audit-mac]] | browser-harness skipped (routing collision, v0.1.8/257 issues); Interceptor v4.3.0 and Browser v10.0.0 confirmed dead on Mac; two-lane strategy (claude-in-chrome + playwright-cli); neuter-don't-delete plan | 2026-08-15.md | 2026-08-15 |\n| [[concepts/skill-description-budget-ceiling]] | 36 of 150 skills exceed the 650-char ceiling (71,248 chars total) and are silently dropped from the session listing; SkillSystem.md 650 vs CreateSkill 1024 doc conflict; `## Enforcement` relocation as the trim template | 2026-08-15.md | 2026-08-15 |\n| [[concepts/skills-repo-git-hygiene]] | Worktree-routed edits (background-isolation guard), explicit-path staging then `.gitignore` for `.claude/worktrees/` nested-repo hazard, four commits to a clean main, two self-caught mistakes | 2026-08-15.md | 2026-08-15 |\n| [[concepts/session-context-footprint-audit]] | doctor-plus audit: ~21.5k tokens always loaded vs ~3,000 claimed in CLAUDE.md, measured ~7,640-token floor; self-contained HTML report with three-theme-state CSS pre-flight checks | 2026-08-15.md | 2026-08-15 |\n| [[concepts/playwright-cli-install-mcp-disable]] | Playwright MCP ships as an official plugin so `claude mcp` won't remove it — disable at the plugin layer, verify three ways, restart to unload still-loaded tools | 2026-08-15.md | 2026-08-15 |\n| [[concepts/handoff-document-placement-discipline]] | Handoffs written to `/tmp/` are wiped on reboot and invisible to a home-directory search — write to the project directory; ask for the project name not the path; don't start a long subagent task near a usage limit | 2026-08-15.md | 2026-08-15 |\n| [[connections/mandatory-routing-language-outranks-runtime-capability]] | Routing reads descriptions, never the filesystem — dead skills win on \"MANDATORY\" phrasing while working skills are dropped for length; stderr-swallowing preconditions make the former rep